  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.38 - AM031 LINQ namesake precision\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM031 complex LINQ SelectMany diagnostics now require System.Linq.Enumerable or System.Linq.Queryable calls\n            - User-defined SelectMany namesakes with nested selector invocations stay quiet\n            - Added regression coverage for custom SelectMany extensions with nested selector logic\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (833 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Local 2.30.38 package build produced expected analyzer payloads\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.37 - AM001 exact numeric conversion modelling",
